      "blurb": "Asari representative on the Citadel Council.",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Tevos is the asari councilor, a consummate diplomat who has represented her people on the Citadel Council for decades. Measured, cautious, and skilled at reading a room, she prefers negotiation and consensus to open confrontation — but centuries of asari biotic training mean she is far from defenseless.</p><p><strong>Biotic Barrier:</strong> 30 Shield HP. Recharges 10 HP per turn.</p><p><strong>Diplomatic Immunity:</strong> Tevos is rarely encountered as a combatant; she is a political power broker whose influence spans Council space.</p>",
